# Copy to backend/.env and fill in locally. backend/.env is gitignored (.env*); never commit keys.
# All optional. Without keys, POST /api/explain answers with the offline template.
# Blank means the default:
#   AI_CHAIN      gemini,groq,template (comma list; template is always appended)
#   AI_OFFLINE    0 (1 = template only, no network)
#   GEMINI_MODEL  gemini-3.8-flash (gemini-3.5-flash-lite is tried after an HTTP error from it)
#   GROQ_MODEL    openai/gpt-oss-120b
AI_CHAIN=
AI_OFFLINE=
GEMINI_API_KEY=
GEMINI_MODEL=
GROQ_API_KEY=
GROQ_MODEL=
